   Chang NB, 2010, J ENVIRON MANAGE, V91, P1397, DOI 10.1016/j.jenvman.2010.02.024.
   Jacobs J., 2008, Satellite based solar radiation, net radiation, and potential and reference evapotranpiration estimates over Florida.},
